<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola cut by Hambrecht.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola cut by Hambrecht.</headline>
<text>
<p>--  Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Rakesh Sood said he lowered his 1996 and 1997 estimates for Motorola Inc after the company announced that Q3 results were likely to be significantly below the consensus estimate of $0.50 and the outlook remains cautious.</p>
<p>-- H&amp;Q cut 1996 estimate from $2.31/shr to $1.97/shr. It also cut 1997 estimate from $3.10 to $2.71 a share.</p>
</text>
